OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA fine,
OL,6,Fbright end to the day and staying dry
OL,7,Fthis evening with clear spells. Patchy
OL,8,Ffog forming in eastern areas later as
OL,9,Fcloud thickens in the west to bring
OL,10,Fsome showery rain by dawn. Milder than
OL,11,Flast night.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FA rather cloudy and at times,
OL,14,Fdamp day with showery rain and drizzle
OL,15,Fedging eastwards across Wales.
OL,16,FPossibly turning a little brighter in
OL,17,Fthe northwest later. Cooler than on
OL,18,FThursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
