OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FBright
OL,6,Fand breezy on Saturday with sunny
OL,7,Fspells and the odd shower. Turning
OL,8,Fwindier on Sunday with heavy rain
OL,9,Farriving, clearing later. Sunny
OL,10,Fperiods on Monday. Temperatures
OL,11,Fremaining above average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
